  body: `Prior Lessons — 1-Sentence Recap

Lesson 078: Integrated packaging supply works when shared information and authority shorten learning loops across otherwise separate factories.

Lesson 079: GPUs preserve flexibility, while custom silicon earns its efficiency only when a stable workload keeps enough deployed chips useful.

Lesson 080: Hyperscalers design chips when workload knowledge, software control and fleet scale outweigh fixed engineering cost and supplier dependence.

